  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;Ins&lt;/span&gt;ufficient&amp;nbsp;information\r\nhas been provided to demonstrate an identified local need for the proposed\r\nchildcare facility or that it would serve the local community. In addition, no\r\nlegal agreement has been secured to guarantee priority placements for children\r\nwithin the London Borough of Harrow, meaning the development would not ensure\r\nthat local childcare needs are met. The proposal therefore represents an\r\ninappropriate change of use, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2024), Policy H12 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies GR1 and HO7 of\r\nHarrow&#x27;s New Local Plan 2021 - 2041 (2025).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposal\r\nresults in the loss of existing residential floorspace, and no justification or\r\nreprovision has been provided to demonstrate that this loss is acceptable. The\r\ndevelopment would therefore lead to an unwarranted reduction in the borough’s\r\nhousing stock, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024),\r\nPolicy H8 of the London Plan (2021) and Strategic Policy 03 Harrow’s New Local\r\nPlan 2021 – 2041 (2025).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
